===== Installation =====

Pressing "USR" button when power is connected OR during the pressing and release of "RESET" button enables booting
from SD card.

Available booting from:
- onboard NAND
- SD card
- USB storage

==== Boot from NAND ====

Valid uboot, kernel and rootfs should be flashed onto NAND.

