===== Bootloader Mods =====
  - you could read about [[docs:techref:bootloader]] in general

There are several scripts available in uboot. These are inside uboot variables and can be executed with the run command.

bootcmd var in uboot-omap 2013
<code>
run findfdt;
mmc dev ${mmcdev};
if mmc rescan; then
  if run userbutton; then
    setenv bootenv uEnv.txt;
  else
    setenv bootenv user.txt;
  fi;
  echo SD/MMC found on device ${mmcdev};
  if run loadbootenv; then 
    echo Loaded environment from ${bootenv};
    run importbootenv;
  fi;
  if test -n $uenvcmd;then
    echo Running uenvcmd ...;
    run uenvcmd;
  fi;
  if run loadimage; then
      run mmcboot;
  fi;
fi;
run nandboot;
setenv bootfile zImage;
if run loadimage; then
  run loadfdt;
  run mmcbootz; 
fi;
</code>
compare to upstream: [[http://git.denx.de/?p=u-boot.git;a=blob;f=include/configs/omap3_beagle.h | omap3_beagle uboot git head]]

